      "text": "Because you are pregnant I'll only use one gentle needle in the tender spot while you lie on your side, for about fifteen minutes. The evidence for acupuncture in back pain is mixed, and limited in pregnancy. Risks are small: soreness, bruising, feeling faint. Other options are antenatal physiotherapy and a support belt. You can ask me to stop at any time."
